      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……久候多时了。\n为了迎接你的到来，\n我的身心都准备万全了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "026d94955c4dd955b19ef08176b61331e7f84a6cb4075a21520c6951b2826482",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
